<title>INDONESIA: London Sumatra 1996 net 80.62 bln rph.</title>
<headline>London Sumatra 1996 net 80.62 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Total revenue		     208.65   vs   188.64</p>
<p>    Net income			   80.62   vs    61.42</p>
<p>    Gross profit			115.25   vs   104.93</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  101.89   vs    94.59</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		 102.82   vs    85.14</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were unaudited. PT London Sumatra operates coconut, cocoa, rubber, tea and coffee plantations and processes and trades in agricultural products.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
